tmpl_index(Post *posts, size_t cnt)

<!DOCTYPE html>
<head>
	<title>me7alix' website</title> 
	<link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>
	<div id="main">
		<h1>Hi there, I'm Michael 👋</h1>
		<p>Welcome to my website! I'm a coder. I love C and Go because of their simplicity. I'm exploring <a href="https://odin-lang.org/">The Odin Programming Language</a>. To me, it's something between C and Go. I'm studying backend development, machine learning, and other subjects related to programming and math.</p>
		<h2>My projects</h2>
		<ul>
			<li><strong><a href="https://github.com/me7alix/nn.h">nn.h:</a></strong> A simple library for creating neural networks in C.</li>
			<li><strong><a href="https://github.com/me7alix/3D-renderer">3D renderer:</a></strong> My first attempt to create a 3D renderer from scratch.</li>
			<li><strong><a href="https://github.com/me7alix/voxel-engine">Voxel engine:</a></strong> My first attempt at creating something on the OpenGL.</li>
			<li><strong><a href="https://github.com/me7alix/network-game">Network game:</a></strong> My first network game written in C using UDP sockets.</li>
			<li><strong><a href="https://github.com/me7alix/bpe.odin">BPE.odin:</a></strong> Implementation of <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Byte_pair_encoding">byte pair encoding</a> algorithm in Odin.</li>
			<li><strong><a href="https://github.com/me7alix/rocket-dudes">Rocket dudes:</a></strong> Multiplayer game written in Odin.</li>
			<li><strong><a href="https://github.com/me7alix/htmpl.h">htmpl.h:</a></strong> HTML templates to C compiler.</li>
		</ul>
		<h2>Github stats</h2>
		<table width="100%">
			<tr>
				<td><img src="https://github-readme-stats.vercel.app/api?username=me7alix&show_icons=true&theme=chartreuse-dark"/></td>
				<td><img src="https://github-readme-stats.vercel.app/api/top-langs/?username=me7alix&theme=chartreuse-dark&layout=compact"/></td>
			</tr>
		</table>
		<h2>Blog posts</h2>
		$ {
			for (size_t i = 0; i < cnt; i++) {
				HTML(`
				<div>
					<h3>%s</h3>
					%s
				</div>
				`, posts[i].title, posts[i].html);
			}
			
			if (cnt == 0) {
				HTML("<h3>There are no posts here yet</h3>");
			}
		}
		<p><br />Thanks for stopping by! Have a great day! 😊</p>
	</div>
</body>
</html>
